@anon.863986d00e4103fb69f29fe2b65b0919.765 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [449 x i8] }> <{ [449 x i8] c"How to [stroke] the cells.\0A\0AStrokes can be disabled by setting this to `{none}`.\0A\0AIf it is necessary to place lines which can cross spacing between cells\0Aproduced by the `gutter` option, or to override the stroke between\0Amultiple specific cells, consider specifying one or more of\0A[`table.hline`]($table.hline) and [`table.vline`]($table.vline)\0Aalongside your table cells.\0A\0ASee the [grid documentation]($grid.stroke) for more information on\0Astrokes." }>, align 1
